# panel-card-sinnoh 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel (Class
# F card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc sinnoh. Original
# in-house art, generated deterministically by w10c-rig/
# gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the arc record: "Lily of the
# Valley Conference — HONOURS." / "Eight badges, a god
# unchained and answered, and the only victory anyone took
# from the conference's darkest trainer... the NOCTARCH that
# fell." Aurora over Borea's snow peaks, the lily valley
# pale below, and one dark star falling; eight ice glints at
# the ridge foot = the recorded eight badges.
